<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#00e676">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Universo Capoeira">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="description" content="App completo da academia Capoeira na Pequena África - check-in, avaliações, mural, pedidos de treino e mais">
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/svgs/solid/child-reaching.svg">
<title>Universo Capoeira v87 - Web &amp; Mobile Edition</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}
:root {
  --primary-green: #00e676;
  --primary-green-dark: #00c853;
  --accent-blue: #00d2ff;
  --accent-blue-dark: #0091ea;
  --card-bg: #16232b;
  --card-border: #2a3f4a;
  --text-main: #f5f7fa;
  --text-sub: #90a4ae;
  --danger: #ef5350;
  --gold: #ffc107;
  --gympass-red: #ff004f;
  --insta-gradient: linear-gradient(45deg, #f09433 0%, #e6683c 25%, #dc2743 50%, #cc2366 75%, #bc1888 100%);
  --shadow-soft: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  --radius: 14px;
}
html, body {
  background-color: #050b0e !important;
  color: var(--text-main) !important;
  width: 100vw !important;
  height: 100vh !important;
  overflow: hidden !important;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}
.app-frame {
  width: 100% !important;
  height: 100% !important;
  max-width: 100vw !important;
  max-height: 100vh !important;
  background: #0f2027;
  border: 2px solid var(--card-border);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom);
}
iframe, [class*="appsgeyser"], [id*="appsgeyser"], [id*="banner"], [class*="banner"], div[style*="position: fixed; bottom: 0"] {
  display: none !important;
  height: 0 !important;
  width: 0 !important;
  opacity: 0 !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  visibility: hidden !important;
}
header {
  background: #11222a;
  padding: 6px 10px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  width: 100%;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  gap: 6px;
}
.logos-header-box { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; }
.app-logo-img { height: 36px; max-height: 48px; max-width: 90px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 6px; display: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 2px; }
.app-title {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--primary-green);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  min-width: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.cronometro-box {
  background: #081217;
  padding: 4px 6px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--accent-blue);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.cronometro-display { font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--accent-blue); font-weight: 700; }
.cronometro-controls { display: flex; gap: 2px; margin-top: 2px; }
.cronometro-btn {
  background: #1a2a32;
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 2px 4px;
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.tabs-container { padding: 6px 8px 2px 8px; background: #091419; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border); flex-shrink: 0; }
.tabs {
  display: flex;
  overflow-x: auto;
  background: #0b171d;
  padding: 4px;
  gap: 4px;
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  width: 100%;
  scrollbar-width: none;
}
.tabs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.tabs button {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 58px;
  padding: 7px 3px;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  color: var(--text-sub);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  border-radius: 8px;
  cursor: pointer;
  white-space: nowrap;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 2px;
  transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
}
.tabs button.active { color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-green-dark), #009624); box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 200, 83, 0.3); }
.tabs-equipe { margin-top: 6px; }
#btnToggleEquipe.active { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-blue-dark), #0277bd); }
.tab-content { display: none; padding: 10px; flex: 1; width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; overflow-y: auto; }
.tab-content.active { display: block; }
.card {
  background: var(--card-bg) !important;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 14px 14px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  width: 100% !important;
  max-width: 100% !important;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
}
.card:hover { border-color: rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.25); }
.card h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--primary-green); font-size: 0.9rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }
.btn {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-green-dark), #00a844);
  border: none;
  color: #fff;
  padding: 11px 10px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 5px 0;
  width: 100%;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 7px;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: transform 0.12s ease, opacity 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 200, 83, 0.25);
}
.btn:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
.btn-secondary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-blue-dark), #0277bd); box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 145, 234, 0.25); }
.btn-danger { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e53935, #c62828); box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(239, 83, 80, 0.25); }
.btn-whatsapp { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25d366, #128c7e); }
.btn-instagram { background: var(--insta-gradient); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(220, 39, 67, 0.3); }
.btn-gympass { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gympass-red), #b30037); color: #fff; }
.btn-gold { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffb300, #ff8f00); color: #1a1a1a; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(255, 179, 0, 0.3); }
.btn-back { background: #37474f; margin-bottom: 8px; box-shadow: none; }
.btn.carregando { opacity: 0.7; pointer-events: none; }
.btn-mini { width: auto; padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 0.72rem; margin: 0; border-radius: 8px; }
.spinner-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 12px;
  height: 12px;
  border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  border-top-color: #fff;
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: girarSpinner 0.6s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes girarSpinner { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
.flex-btn { display: flex; gap: 6px; width: 100%; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.flex-btn .btn { flex: 1 1 110px; min-width: 0; }
input, select, textarea {
  width: 100% !important;
  padding: 8px 10px;
  margin: 3px 0;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  background: #0a1419;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  outline: none;
}
textarea { min-height: 64px; resize: vertical; }
.lado-flex { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin: 2px 0; }
.lado-flex input { flex: 1; }
.campo-label { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-sub); margin: 6px 0 2px; display: block; font-weight: 600; }
.modal-overlay {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  z-index: 9999;
  display: none;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 16px;
}
.modal-overlay.aberto { display: flex; }
.modal-card {
  background: #11222a;
  border: 1px solid var(--accent-blue);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 16px;
  max-width: 340px;
  width: 100%;
  max-height: 82vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
  color: #fff;
}
#overlayTimerGrande {
  display: none;
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
  z-index: 9999;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
#overlayTimerGrande.aberto { display: flex; }
footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 8px;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  color: var(--text-sub);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  margin-top: auto;
  width: 100%;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
footer a { color: var(--accent-blue); }
.toast {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 20px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  background: var(--primary-green-dark);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  z-index: 10000;
  display: none;
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 90%;
}
.toast.erro { background: var(--danger); }
.alerta-dificuldade {
  background: rgba(198, 40, 40, 0.2);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--danger);
  padding: 4px 6px;
  margin: 3px 0;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
}
.aviso-info {
  background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.12);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue);
  padding: 4px 6px;
  margin: 6px 0;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
}
.badge-count { background: var(--gold); color: #000; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.75rem; }
.status-firebase { font-size: 0.65rem; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; margin-left: 6px; }
.status-online { background: #1b5e20; color: #a5d6a7; }
.status-offline { background: #b71c1c; color: #ffcdd2; }
.lista-item {
  background: #0c151a;
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  border-radius: 11px;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  margin: 7px 0;
  font-size: 0.76rem;
  transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
}
.lista-item:hover { border-color: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.25); }
.lista-item b { color: var(--primary-green); }
.linha { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.mini { font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--text-sub); }
.pill { display: inline-block; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
.pill-ok { background: #1b5e20; color: #a5d6a7; }
.pill-pend { background: #5d4037; color: #ffe0b2; }
.pill-no { background: #b71c1c; color: #ffcdd2; }
.pill-info { background: #01579b; color: #b3e5fc; }
.sem-dados { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-sub); font-style: italic; padding: 4px 0; }
.chat-msg { background: #0a1419; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue); border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 8px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
.chat-msg img { max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 4px; display: block; }
.lock-card { border: 1px solid var(--gold) !important; }
.timer-grande-btn { width: 60px; height: 60px; font-size: 1.4rem; }
.grade-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; }
.grade-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; }
.preview-foto { max-width: 92px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid var(--primary-green); display: block; margin: 4px auto; }
.certificado-area {
  background: #fff9e6;
  color: #1a2a32;
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 14px;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
}
.certificado-area h2 { color: #8d6e00; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.certificado-area .nome { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: #1b5e20; margin: 6px 0; }

/* ===== Assistente Virtual ===== */
#assistenteFab {
  position: fixed;
  right: 14px;
  bottom: 18px;
  width: 54px;
  height: 54px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: none;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-green-dark), #00a844);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0, 200, 83, 0.45);
  z-index: 9500;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  transition: transform 0.15s ease;
}
#assistenteFab:active { transform: scale(0.94); }
#assistentePainel {
  display: none;
  position: fixed;
  right: 12px;
  bottom: 80px;
  width: min(340px, calc(100vw - 24px));
  max-height: min(70vh, 520px);
  background: #11222a;
  border: 1px solid var(--accent-blue);
  border-radius: 16px;
  z-index: 9501;
  flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
}
#assistentePainel.aberto { display: flex; }
.assistente-header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d3d1f, #0a2a38);
  padding: 10px 12px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
}
.assistente-header h4 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--primary-green);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}
.assistente-msgs {
  flex: 1;
  overflow-y: auto;
  padding: 10px;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  background: #0a1419;
}
.assistente-bolha {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  padding: 8px 10px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  max-width: 92%;
  line-height: 1.4;
  white-space: pre-wrap;
}
.assistente-bolha.bot {
  background: #1a2a32;
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  color: #e0f2f1;
  border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
}
.assistente-bolha.user {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b5e20, #00a844);
  color: #fff;
  margin-left: auto;
  border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
}
.assistente-atalhos {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 4px;
  padding: 6px 8px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  background: #0d1a20;
}
.assistente-atalho {
  background: #1a2a32;
  border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  color: var(--text-sub);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 4px 9px;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.assistente-atalho:active { background: var(--primary-green-dark); color: #fff; }
.assistente-input-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 4px;
  padding: 8px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  background: #11222a;
}
.assistente-input-row input {
  flex: 1;
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
}
.assistente-input-row button {
  width: auto;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  border-radius: 8px;
}
</style>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/9.22.1/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/9.22.1/firebase-firestore-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/9.22.1/firebase-storage-compat.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-frame">

  <!-- ================= CABEÇALHO ================= -->
  <header>
    <div class="logos-header-box">
      <img id="headerLogo1" class="app-logo-img" alt="Logo 1">
      <img id="headerLogo2" class="app-logo-img" alt="Logo 2">
      <div class="app-title" id="headerAppTitle">
        <i class="fas fa-child-reaching"></i>
        <span id="headerTituloTexto">Universo Capoeira</span>
        <span id="firebaseStatus" class="status-firebase status-offline">OFFLINE</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cronometro-box">
      <div class="cronometro-display" id="timerDisplay" onclick="abrirTimerTelaCheia()" style="cursor:pointer;">01:30</div>
      <div class="cronometro-controls">
        <button class="cronometro-btn" onclick="iniciarPausarTimer()" id="btnStartTimer" title="Iniciar/Pausar"><i class="fas fa-play"></i></button>
        <button class="cronometro-btn" onclick="resetarTimer()" title="Zerar"><i class="fas fa-undo"></i></button>
        <button class="cronometro-btn" onclick="abrirTimerTelaCheia()" title="Tela cheia"><i class="fas fa-expand"></i></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ================= CRONÔMETRO TELA CHEIA ================= -->
  <div id="overlayTimerGrande">
    <div id="timerDisplayGrande" style="font-family:monospace; font-size:22vw; font-weight:800; color:var(--accent-blue);">01:30</div>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:16px; margin-top:20px;">
      <button class="cronometro-btn timer-grande-btn" onclick="iniciarPausarTimer()" id="btnStartTimerGrande"><i class="fas fa-play"></i></button>
      <button class="cronometro-btn timer-grande-btn" onclick="resetarTimer()"><i class="fas fa-undo"></i></button>
      <button class="cronometro-btn timer-grande-btn" onclick="fecharTimerTelaCheia()"><i class="fas fa-compress"></i></button>
    </div>
    <p class="mini" style="margin-top:18px;">Toque em ▶ para iniciar a roda</p>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= ABAS ================= -->
  <div class="tabs-container">
    <div class="tabs" id="protectedSystemTabs">
      <button class="active" onclick="abrirAba('tab1', this)"><i class="fas fa-home"></i>Início</button>
      <button onclick="abrirAba('tab2', this)"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i>Check-in</button>
      <button onclick="abrirAba('tab3', this)"><i class="fas fa-user-graduate"></i>Aluno</button>
      <button onclick="toggleMenuEquipe()" id="btnToggleEquipe"><i class="fas fa-users-cog"></i>Equipe</button>
    </div>
    <div class="tabs tabs-equipe" id="tabsEquipe" style="display:none;">
      <button onclick="abrirAba('tab4', this)"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher"></i>Professor</button>
      <button onclick="abrirAba('tab5', this)"><i class="fas fa-sliders-h"></i>ADM</button>
      <button onclick="abrirAba('tab6', this)"><i class="fas fa-code"></i>Dev</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ================= ABA 1 - INÍCIO ================= -->
  <div id="tab1" class="tab-content active">

    <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--gold);">
      <h3 style="color:var(--gold);"><i class="fas fa-bell"></i> Avisos do Professor</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.72rem; color:var(--text-sub); margin-bottom:8px;">Ative para receber um aviso no seu celular quando o professor publicar algo novo (enquanto o app estiver aberto):</p>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="btnAtivarNotificacao" onclick="pedirPermissaoNotificacao()"><i class="fas fa-bell"></i> Ativar Notificações</button>
    </div>

    <div class="card" id="cardHorarioFixoInicio" style="border:1px solid var(--primary-green); display:none;">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-calendar-week"></i> Horário Fixo da Semana</h3>
      <div id="listaHorarioFixoInicio"></div>
      <button class="btn" id="btnConfirmarPresencaHoje" style="margin-top:8px; display:none;" onclick="confirmarPresencaHoje()"><i class="fas fa-hand-point-up"></i> Vou Comparecer Hoje</button>
      <p id="txtJaConfirmouHoje" style="display:none; font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--primary-green); margin-top:6px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Presença confirmada para hoje!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="border:1px solid #e6683c;">
      <h3 style="color:#f09433;"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i> Instagram da Academia</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.72rem; color:var(--text-sub); margin-bottom:8px;">Acompanhe as fotos, vídeos e novidades no nosso perfil oficial:</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:bold; color:#fff; margin-bottom:8px;" id="handleInstagramAcademiaTxt">@capoeiranapequenaafrica</p>
      <button class="btn btn-instagram" onclick="abrirInstagramOficial()"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i> Acessar Instagram Oficial</button>
      <div id="feedInstagramInicio" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card" id="boxNotificacaoAluno" style="display:none; border:1px solid var(--accent-blue);">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-broadcast-tower" style="color:var(--accent-blue);"></i> Local Notificado pelo Professor</h3>
      <p id="textoNotificacaoLocal" style="font-size:0.75rem; color:#fff;"></p>
      <a id="linkGmapsNotificacao" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:none; color:var(--primary-green); font-size:0.7rem; text-decoration:underline; margin-top:4px;">Ver no Google Maps</a>
